		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Corpulent purple ogre, every inch of skin covered in blinking, staring eyes. Steals memories, which it savors.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 43, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +6 (2d6 + steal memories), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Eye Probe</strong>. As an action, can detach and send up to six eyeballs floating up to far. Can see through eyes.</p><p></p><p><strong>Light Blindness</strong>. Blinded in bright light.</p><p></p><p><strong>Steal Memories</strong>. WIS 12+ or 1d4 weeks of recent memories are stolen by the hyakume, which remembers them vividly. On a natural 1, 1d4 years of memories lost.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
